    "text": "A box released on 17 November 2023, with the Roaring Moon ex Box, holding the Iron Valiant ex promo SVP 068, a reprint of Paradox Rift's Iron Valiant ex in art not yet released in Japan, at regular size and as a jumbo. It also held cosmos holofoil copies of two cards for Paradox Rift's new Future mechanic, Iron Moth and Future Booster Energy Capsule, found in no booster pack, four booster packs and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live."
